[ 'X' BIND X 0 X SUB MAX ] 'R2A.ABS' DEF
[ CHARS 'C' BIND C 0 GET UPPER C 1 DROP JOIN 2 COLLECT JOIN ] 'R2A.CAP' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V V X2.ZILOLE SUB R2A.ABS X2.ZILOLE ] 'R2A.MAD' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V -2 DROP V 1 DROP -1 DROP ADD V 2 DROP ADD 3 DIV ] 'R2A.MOVING3' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V V 0 GET [ MAX ] SCAN ] 'R2A.RUNMAX' DEF
[ SORT TALLY X2.PIDOZE ] 'R2A.MODE' DEF
[ 'R' BIND R KEYS R VALUES 2 COLLECT ZIP [ 1 GET 0 LT ] FILTER [ 0 GET ] MAP ] 'R2A.NEGKEYS' DEF
[ [ 'a' 1 ] [ 'b' 4 ] [ 'a' 3 ] ]
'E' BIND E E ZIP 1 GET X2.FOMOZO GET
